<div class="info-page">
  <h1>About Marketing Tools</h1>
  <p>Marketing Tools is a collection of free online utilities built for digital marketers, SEO specialists, and content creators. Every tool is designed to solve a real-world task — from building UTM links to validating email lists.</p>

  <h2>Why these tools?</h2>
  <p>We noticed that marketers often jump between a dozen browser tabs to get simple things done. This site brings the most commonly needed utilities together in one place, with no sign-ups, no ads, and no data collection.</p>

  <h2>What's here</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>URL Tools</strong> — UTM Builder, URL Shortener, Redirect Checker, QR Generator</li>
    <li><strong>Text Tools</strong> — Diff Checker, Encoder/Decoder, Character Counter, Cyrillic Detector, HTML Editor, Transposition Tool</li>
    <li><strong>Validation</strong> — Email Validator, Phone Validator</li>
    <li><strong>Media Tools</strong> — Image Resizer, Creative Preview, VAST Inspector</li>
    <li><strong>Guides</strong> — Excel Macros, Image Resize Guide, Video Editor Comparisons, Marketing Dictionary</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Technology</h2>
  <p>Built with Node.js, Express, and EJS. All processing happens in your browser or on the server — nothing is sent to third parties.</p>
</div>

